.TH start-container-clear-health 1  "clear-health " 
.SH NAME
start\-container\-clear\-health \- Remove this service\*(Aqs health check results
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-container clear\-health\fR [\fB\-\-only\fR] [\fB\-\-except\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove this service\*(Aqs health check results
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-only\fR [\fI<ONLY>...\fR]
Only clear these health check IDs
.TP
\fB\-\-except\fR [\fI<EXCEPT>...\fR]
Health check IDs to exclude
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
